			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I feel like they mean restore from regular backups but since it's marketing speak it has to sound more dramatic for non-tech people.</p><p>I don't use WP.com but I've never had to recover a site either. I've had to restore several from backups but that's fairly common.</p>",
